window.products.push({"id":722234,"name":"DeLonghi DC312T 14-Cup Drip Coffeemaker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gurNflp3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brew up to 14 cups (70 ounces) of great-tasting coffee with this easy-to-use drip coffeemaker. The unit's showerhead design helps extract coffee's full natural flavor by allowing water to completely saturate all coffee grounds, while its aroma button activates a unique brewing process that enhances the flavor and aroma of coffee. The coffeemaker achieves this full-bodied flavor by saturating the grounds a little at a time using a time-released process that dispenses water into the filter basket in 30-second intervals. It also provides a pause-and-serve function, for pouring a quick cup midbrew, and a 24-hour programmable timer with two-hour automatic shut-off. Setting the timer allows for waking up to the aroma of freshly brewed coffee or for having coffee ready to serve with dessert without having to get up from the table half way through dinner. Other highlights include simple push-button controls, a digital display, an internal water-level indicator, and a durable, easy-to-clean washable nylon filter, as well as a non-stick warming plate and cord storage to help keep countertops tidy. A glass carafe with a generous stay-cool handle and drip-free pour spout comes included. The drip coffeemaker measures approximately 12-1/2 by 9-3/4 by 8-1/2 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gurNflp3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De'Longhi","source_asin":"B0016HHQKI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-722234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0016HHQKI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0016HHQKI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":722235,"name":"JEROAL Metal Closet Heavy Duty Clothes Rack, Freestanding Garment Organizer Closet, Open Wardrobe Closet Storage Organizer with Hanging Rod and 5 Tier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jbv92rfYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ample Storage Space: Measuring of 47.24” W x 15.75” D x 70.07” H(120 x 40 x 178cm). The 5 metal shelves offer enough space to store your clothes, hats, bags, footwear, and personal belongings. The metal vertical hanging rods ensure garments of all sizes and shapes can breathe, providing a place to hang your coats to corral even more clutter. This Metal Clothes Closet holds clothes and accessories in style and ensure they are visible and instantly accessible. Contemporary and Sleek Design: Using wrought iron with a beautiful side scroll in the sturdy metal frame, add an elegant style in your home. It’s made with function in mind and looks great in use. The Hanging Clothing Rack great for laundry room, bedroom, foyer, whatever you prefer. Providing a clean and comfortable living space. Heavy Duty and Sturdy Structure: The heavy-duty clothing rack made of glossy black powder-coated metal tubes and metal shelves. Strengthened dia 19 mm tube and the metal shelves make this clothes closet bear much heavier load and more durable while using. This clothing rack is of high quality and built to last a long-term closet storage solution. Additional Function for use: Metal feet with the adjustable pad on each side can balance the garment rack on the uneven ground. The anti-slip cross rail on the top shelf keeps your items from falling. Easy to Put Together: Comes with step by step assembly instructions. All the accessories are marked with numbers, making it very easy to assemble with the instructions and tools included in the package. Please do not hesitate to contact us via Amazon Buyer Message for any issue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jbv92rfYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JEROAL","source_asin":"B08RBPN9FC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-722235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RBPN9FC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RBPN9FC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":722236,"name":"Homesick Scented Candle, New York","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cXC7VLWWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Founded in 2016, Homesick creates authentic, hand-poured products that draw on the power of scent to evoke treasured memories of people, places, and memories. Each fragrance is extensively researched and developed by our team of storytellers, perfume chemists, and chandlers in collaboration with passion communities. Made from a natural soy wax blend with premium cotton wicks and custom fragrance oils, our candles are non toxic, contain no lead, plastics, parabens or phthalates and are hand poured in small batches in Massachusetts. From the Manufacturer Bring home to you, no matter where you are Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. States, Cities, Countries and Memories Whether it’s the seabreezes of Southern California, the distinctive scents of spring days in Central Park in NYC or the vibrance of the energy that pulses through Brasil we have you covered. Books Scent: The main theme is an older leather bound book accord mixed with a woody desk character of cedar and sandalwood. Hints of balsamic and vanilla finish the complex scent. Grandmas Kitchen Table Scent: The scents of rich butter mixed with touches of apple, cinnamon, clove and a hint of sugar cookie. Tonka bean and sugar finish out this homey aroma. Summer Camp Scent: Fresh green grass accord with hints of crystal clear lake water, blooming hyacinth found along trails and just a touch of fresh lemon and smoke. Take Me Home Scent is the strongest tie to memory. Inhaling those sweet aromas while your mind immediately travesl back to those carefree days or amazing experienes. Home can mean so many things and it can be in so many places. Homesick Candles allows you bring bring all of those memories with you, no matter where you go! From your childhood state, to the city where you got engaged, to the best vacation ever in Hawaii to that epic Road Trip with your friends. We have a custom scent for all US States, iconic cities, vibrant countries and those memorable experiences. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Nostalgic, Memories, All-Natural How did you come up with the idea for this product? We were living in NYC and yet all of us were from somewhere else and missing home. In the winter of 2016, we sought out to find a way to keep that place with you, no matter where you live. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. keep that place with you, no matter where you live. What makes your product special? We finely craft custom scents that are tied to places and memories. Nostalgia in the warmth of a candle. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Collaborating with other small businesses and local input. We feel like we've taken a road trip thru the entire USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cXC7VLWWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homesick","source_asin":"B06XGKB3BZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-722236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XGKB3BZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XGKB3BZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
