window.products.push({"id":722307,"name":"CHESITY King Quilt Set King Size Plaid Quilt 3-Piece Navy Blue Plaid Bedding Sets Reversible Lightweight Stripe Quilt Grid Coverlet Bedspread Patchwor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8176w17Pi4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💙【Reversible Plaid Bedding Set Design】The king size quilt with coordinating shams feature a relaxed white and navy blue checked design, its unique details give you a subtle style and touch of elegance. The classic reversible plaid patchwork quilt provides a distinctive, stylish look while providing comfort. 💙【3 Piece Navy Blue Plaid Quilt Set】 The king quilt bedding set includes a quilt (96\"x108\"), 2 king pillow shams (20\"*36\"+2\"). Add a touch of decorative enchantment to your room with our fashionable and serene theme bedding set. Can be used as a bed sheet or blanket in winter, the lightweight quilts are very easy to move your body freely when sleeping at night. 💙【Soft & Lightweight King Plaid Bedspread Set】 King quilt bedding set is made with 80 GSM, polyester microfiber fabric, the filling is 120 GSM lightweight cotton fill, it is very soft to touch and makes you feel warm and breathable when you sleep. The lightweight and portable blue quilt set can be placed in the bedroom at home or taken on vacation. 💙【Well-Made Workmanship】 The bedding king set is ultrasonically embossed and tightly seamed, fabric edge perfect stitching. The king size plaid bedspread coverlet is wrinkle-resistant, sturdy, and durable, resistant to fading, can be used long time, and is suitable for all seasons. Oversized Coverlet easily Covers all sides and ends of the bed. 💙【Wash Instructions】Please Machine washes cold, separately with a gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry with a gentle cycle. This king plaid bedding printed with a classic plaid pattern brings a touch of traditional appeal and warmth. It remains comfortable and breathable even after washing and can be used for many years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8176w17Pi4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHESITY","source_asin":"B09KGTRW9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-722307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KGTRW9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KGTRW9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
