window.products.push({"id":722508,"name":"Peugeot Wine Tasting Aid for Wine Tasting Education","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gbXzLie1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easily organize a wine tasting with the Tasting Aid. Each placemat style Tasting Aid offers visual support to the participants and guides them through the different steps in tasting (observe, smell, taste). The accompanying booklet of descriptive terms offers complimentary technical explanations such as grape varieties and wine tasting temperatures. 8 tasting aids are included in the set (4 for red, 4 for white), but it is not necessary for each participant to have their own aid if there is a larger group. Intended for use by novices and experts, the aid itself assists with fundamentals and the complementary information invites the more experienced to expand their knowledge. To clean, simply wipe with a damp cloth or sponge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gbXzLie1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B003NURW4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-722508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003NURW4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003NURW4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":722509,"name":"FitNek Cervical TPE Pillow, Contour Pillows for Ergonomic Orthopedic Sleeping Neck Contoured Support Pillow for Side Sleepers, Back and Stomach Sleepe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710gI9Tsk4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Here is a smart pillow that fits your neck no matter how you position your head. The 1,038 triangular column structure fully supports the curves of your neck and back. The hollow structure of the triangular columns help air circulate around your head for fresh and cool feeling throughout the night. ACCORDING TO RESEARCH PEOPLE USUALLY CHANGE THEIR POSTURE 30 TO 40 TIMES DURING ONE NIGHT’S SLEEP. For soft cotton pillow, your head would sink into the pillow and make it difficult to turn your head around. It may also feel hot. For memory foam pillow, the original shape gradually collapses and catches your head in it, also making it difficult to move freely while sleeping. The elastic nature of TPE of FitNek supports for your neck and ensures free movement of your head during sleep, while providing fluffiness of a cotton pillow and the fitting feel of a memory foam pillow at the same time. TPE(Thermo Plastic Elastomer) is a material that has characteristics of both plastic and rubber. It is safe enough to be used as a pacifier or feeding bottle for babies. Double layered FitNek’s height is freely adjustable, providing a perfect fit for anyone's neck by fiber filler, which you can add or remove to fit your neck. For people who sweat a lot while sleeping because of high body heat, the cool TPE of FitNek is the best choice. ‘Q-MAX’ measures the level of body temperature absorption when a material contacts your skin. FitNek’s Q-MAX is 2-6 times higher than that of ordinary cotton or memory foam pillow. This means that the moment you lie down on the FitNek, you will feel cool. EASY WASHING, ENVIRONMENT-FRIENDLY COVER Cleanness is the basis of pillow care! The top TPE layer can be easily washed by hand anytime and the lower fiber layer can be machine washed easily. Enclosed fabric cover is made by eco-friendly Engler beech pulp by Lenzing group, Austria.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710gI9Tsk4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FitNek","source_asin":"B09ZTLWWGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-722509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZTLWWGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZTLWWGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
