window.products.push({"id":722572,"name":"The C.H.O. Hilarious Square Laundry Hamper | Grey Laundry Schedule | 55 Liters of Heavy Duty Cotton Canvas | 21 Inches Tall x 16 Inches Wide | Collaps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mGiv3a9OL._AC_.jpg","description":"It's Always Laundry Day, With Our Fun, Yet Minimalist Laundry Bags! Stay organized with this high quality sorting unit! Coming in Grey with Black \"Laundry Schedule\" text, this bag is great for staying organized with light or dark clothing. Grade A 100% Cotton Twill Made out of the best cotton on the market, and woven in a twill style, these will last you for years and years ...and years! Perfect for an infant, nursery, baby, and kids room, the 100% PEVA liner interior makes this hamper waterproof. Triple stitched handles won't rip or tear, like some cheaply made baskets and pop up hampers. They also come with a drawstring closure, which gives over 4,150 cubic inches of total space! No need for a hamper with a lid... ...these give more room and flexibility! These clothes organizers are 21\" tall and 16\" wide. That is plenty of space, but the drawstring closure can add more, giving you a total of nearly 30\" in extra large height ready to take your laundry anyhere! And the best? You can hang these portable bags from anywhere using the handles, but they can stand up on their own! Canvas Totes Perfect For College Students and Dorm Rooms! These can be stored on bathroom closet shelves or next to drawers and cabinets full of linen, but they'll be right there to be your clothing divider whenever you need them! Easily fold them and store anywhere you like, or use them as a storage container and organization set. Place magazines, garments, cased food, quilts, toys, towels and anything else you like! Their multiple uses will surprise your wildest ideas! Don't Go to A Big Box Store and Get A Cheap Necessity. Get Our Amazing Quality Sorting System Today! Click Add To Cart!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mGiv3a9OL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The C.H.O.","source_asin":"B074FWQV91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-722572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074FWQV91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074FWQV91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
