window.products.push({"id":722587,"name":"ONEISALL 34oz Large Tea Infuser Bottle Tea Tumbler with Filter - Double Wall Borosilicate Glass Water Bottle with Sleeve for Loose Leaf Tea Coffee and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uZfHPtZlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ LARGE CAPACITY - 1000ml / 34oz, large capacity for daily hydration. As it is made of high quality double wall insulated glass, the bottle is strong/durable and a little bit big/heavy, please refer to the detailed measurements here: size 3.5×11 inches(9×28cm), weight: 2.1lbs(0.96kg). The image of size comparison also located on one of the left images for your reference. ★ MULTIPLE USES - With a removable stainless steel tea infuser/strainer, this tea bottle can be used as a tea bottle/fruit infuser bottle, the filter can effectively filter tea leaves/fruit dregs, enhance the purity and taste of your drink. It can also use as a basic bottle, just remove the filter and use it for coffee, juice, all kinds of beverage. ★ HOW TO USE THE TEA INFUSER - Put loose leaves tea or tea bag inside the main compartment, then put the filter on top, and fill it with hot water. You don't have to remove the tea leaves before drinking. The filter keeps the leaves in the bottle when you upend it to drink. ★ PORTABLE TRAVEL TEA MUG - Come with a soft protective carrying sleeve, you can carry this travel mug around, convenient for outdoor and on-the-go. Well sealed lid completely prevents leakage. Comes with a bottle brush for easy cleaning ★ SAFETY MATERIAL & ECO-FRIENDLY - BPA-FREE and LEAD-FREE, premium healthy glass, protecting the tea tumbler from oxidation and flavor transfer. All ONEISALL products come with guarantee of food grade materials and are environmentally friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uZfHPtZlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"oneisall","source_asin":"B0B51MMTHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-722587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B51MMTHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B51MMTHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
