window.products.push({"id":722623,"name":"SILVERANT Titanium Coffee French Press Cup Camping Mug Travel Coffee Maker for Backpacking Hiking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lMbSkpBGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝐃𝐀𝐈𝐋𝐘 𝐑𝐎𝐔𝐓𝐈𝐍𝐄 - For those that love being outdoors, nothing quite tastes as good as that morning coffee. With the SilverAnt ultralight titanium coffee french press bring your favorite ground coffee with you on your camping, backpacking, and hiking trips. Wake up, turn on your gas stove, boil some water, add your coffee grounds, wait a minute or so for that great coffee flavor, push the french press plunger slowly down, and pour into the 2 cups. Share a great hot drink in the morning with friends and family in outdoors together. 𝐔𝐋𝐓𝐑𝐀𝐋𝐈𝐆𝐇𝐓- Weighing only 158g/5.57oz and the capacity of our SilverAnt coffee french press is 500ml/17.6fl oz . It's a titanium coffee maker that's durable, strong, and lightweight. When not making that magical morning brew fold the coffee press handles and store inside the drawstring mesh bag. 𝐓𝐈𝐓𝐀𝐍𝐈𝐔𝐌 - SilverAnt makes all our gear using titanium. Titanium is a fantastic material because it protects your beverages taste, and is built for a lifetime of adventure. The SilverAnt titanium coffee french press is made with a single wall construction which is made solely of titanium. The only non-titanium element in the set is the wooden coffee press plunger knob. 𝐂𝐄𝐑𝐓𝐈𝐅𝐈𝐄𝐃 - SilverAnt is an ISO:9001:2015 company. All our products are certified by the leading US, EU, and Japanese governing bodies. Titanium is a safe material it doesn't alter the flavor or taste of your liquids. No odors even after years of use. Use your titanium coffee french press every day with confidence. To clean use a mild detergent and warm water. Rinse well, especially the coffee press filter. Dry and store ready for your next adventure. 𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐏𝐑𝐎𝐌𝐈𝐒𝐄 - When you buy a SilverAnt product we provide a lifetime guarantee. We do this because as a team we also seek to purchase lifelong products that have a long lifespan. SilverAnt hopes our products can have their own stories and can contribute to making your time outdoors more memorable. Contact us for further information regarding warranties or returns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lMbSkpBGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SILVERANT","source_asin":"B09NRGX91X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-722623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NRGX91X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NRGX91X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
