window.products.push({"id":722803,"name":"Yunkeeper Black Fabric Cubby Storage Bins，13x13x13 Inches ，Cube Organizer Bins Foldable Storage Bins with Dual Handles Fabric Organizer Bins and Baske","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714KbRMJx7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Dual Handles Design】Dimension:13 \"x 13 \" x 13 \"，The carrying handles design of our collapsible storage cube make the cube storage organizer basket easy for you to carry heavy loads, while the superior fabric quality ensures that the box has the strength to bear. The dual handles function like drawers, sliding in and pulling out for easy access to stored more items. 【High-Quality Material】These foldable storage organization bins cubes are made of top-grade non-woven fabric, which is sturdy for long time use. The high-quality material of the cubbies storage cubes bins can maintain shape and strength. The foldable storage cubes have large enough to organize lots of household and personal goods. 【Perfect Storage Solution】 Cube storage baskets made of stylish, sturdy, eco-friendly fabric provide an attractive storage solution to organize items, keeping items tidy and organized, say goodbye to messy, and enjoy a comfortable life. The breathable material of the organizer storage can protect your things from dust and dump. Our foldable storage cubes organizer makes things organizer easy to find, and make more space. 【Easy to Storage】This storage basket maximizes storage possibilities by providing you lightweight and space-saving solutions. Every collapsible storage bins basket can be tucked away in closets, dressers, in storage cubes, or cars, pantries, toy rooms, offices, bedroom, living room, and more. 【Wide Applications】The black fabric storage bins are suitable for storing and organizing clothes,towels, linens, children 's toys, magazines, books, arts and crafts, office supplies, and more. You could simply fold these dorm storage bins up when you don't use them. These cube storage bins are space-saving and convenient to take along.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714KbRMJx7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yunkeeper","source_asin":"B09VY8JGG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-722803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VY8JGG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VY8JGG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
